    {
      "id": "impress.skip_ok",
      "speaker": "maris_quell",
      "text": "A man who can refuse a stupid window. Calendar that. Taly, spare me the face \u2014 he can still humiliate himself on his own schedule. I have a dock argument to win tonight that isn't about him.",
