    {
      "id": "salon.genuine_seen",
      "speaker": "maris_quell",
      "text": "Truth or expensive imitation \u2014 I'll allow both until the evidence arrives. For what it's worth, I nearly opened with a joke about container ships and emotional baggage. It died in my throat. Some jokes deserve the dry dock.",
