    {
      "id": "salon.genuine_work",
      "speaker": "maris_quell",
      "text": "Page four was bait for the right enemies. Congratulations \u2014 you're inconvenient in the useful way. Observatory needs people who can disagree without needing a medal. Flowers are cheaper than that, and less rare.",
