    {
      "id": "salon.impress_hook",
      "speaker": "taly_renn",
      "text": "I'm back. The champagne is sparkling denial. Orth \u2014 Voss is circulating like a rumor with cufflinks. If you need to impress someone, now's the stupid window. If you don't, I'll respect the restraint and mock you later.",
